		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Electron-Impact Ionization of Multicharged Ions at ORNL</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>http://www.cfadc.phy.ornl.gov/xbeam/xbmintro.html</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; 2019-12-04: The repository is no longer available &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt;
Presented here are experimental ionization cross sections measured using the Electron-Ion Crossed Beams apparatus in the Multicharged Ion Research Facility (MIRF) at the Physics Division of Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL). The data are given in both graphical and tabular form along with the reference to the original publication of the experimental results. Also presented in the figures are theoretical cross sections supporting the experiments.</r3d:description>
